    "blurb": "Automate OOS lot conversion orchestration",
    "overview": "Automate out-of-spec (OOS) lot conversion for cell therapy with agentic process orchestration, physician communication capture, and full auditability for compliance. Agentic orchestration handles real-time physician communications and routes actions through governed processes with human-in-the-loop oversight.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Lot conversion process orchestration for commercial to clinical case execution",
    "splashDescription": "In advanced cell and gene therapy operations, lot conversion is a critical, patient-specific process that becomes necessary when a manufactured lot shifts from a commercial to a clinical pathway due to out-of-spec (OOS) conditions. This challenge is exacerbated by manual handling, fragmented systems, and the need for near real-time coordination across multiple domains. Traditional email-driven coordination models are unsustainable at scale due to their impact on patient treatment timelines and regulatory compliance. This solution addresses these challenges by providing an enterprise orchestration capability that brings structure, speed, and traceability to this complex process.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/780873/overview/img7887124034167557305.png?5bfc69fa4c3b66f4a41c76ae263cb996",
    "imageSrcset": {
      "default": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/780873/overview/img7887124034167557305.png",
      "2x": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/780873/overview/img7887124034167557305-2x.png",
      "1x": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/780873/overview/img7887124034167557305.png"
    },
    "demoUrl": "https://youtu.be/nY0eTVygdPg",
    "documentationUrl": "https://forum.camunda.io/",
    "downloadDocumentationUrl": null,
    "systemRequirements": null,
    "downloadFileSize": null,
    "benefits": [
      {
        "title": "Objectives of the Solution",
        "description": "The primary goal is to automate and orchestrate the end-to-end lot conversion process during an OOS event, ensuring faster and more reliable decision-making without compromising compliance. The solution aims to reduce manual intervention, enable real-time data absorption, support AI-driven disposition decisions, and ensure synchronized updates across downstream enterprise systems."
      },
      {
        "title": "Automation Using Camunda and Benefits",
        "description": "Utilizing Camunda-based process orchestration combined with Agentic AI, the solution automates the flow from OOS detection through physician quality checks, disposition decisions, lot conversion, and downstream system updates. Camunda provides the real-time BPMN orchestration backbone, coordinating tasks across quality, clinical, and supply chain systems. AI components assist in parsing unstructured inputs and supporting decision intelligence for lot disposition. The benefits include real-time orchestration across multiple systems, improved traceability for regulatory audits, reduced manual effort, faster turnaround for patient-critical decisions, across the cell therapy value chain."
      }
    ],
